## Description

In this video I show you a super comprehensive step by step tutorial on how to use yolov8 to train an object detector on your own custom dataset!

Code: https://www.patreon.com/posts/source-code-on-146365540

Step by step tutorial on how to download data from the Open Images Dataset v7: https://bit.ly/46Ue4kC

